<div x-data>
 <p class="page-note">Bolsa de demostración guardada en este navegador. No aparta existencias ni genera pedidos.</p>
 <div class="blade-columns">
  <section class="blade-panel"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Tu equipo</h2><p class="store-empty" x-show="$store.shop.items.length === 0">Tu bolsa está vacía. <a class="underline" href="{{ route('store.catalog') }}">Explora el catálogo</a>.</p>
   <ul class="cart-list"><template x-for="product in $store.shop.items" :key="product.id"><li><div><a class="font-bold" :href="'/productos/' + encodeURIComponent(product.id)" x-text="product.name"></a><p class="page-note" x-text="$store.shop.price(product.prices[$store.shop.currency])"></p></div><div class="blade-actions"><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="'Restar ' + product.name" @click="$store.shop.change(product.id,-1)">−</button><span x-text="$store.shop.quantities[product.id]"></span><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="'Sumar ' + product.name" :disabled="$store.shop.quantities[product.id] >= 9" @click="$store.shop.change(product.id,1)">+</button><button class="text-button" @click="$store.shop.change(product.id,'remove')">Quitar</button></div></li></template></ul>
   <button type="button" class="text-button mt-4" x-show="$store.shop.count > 0" @click="$store.shop.clear()">Vaciar bolsa</button>
  </section>
  <aside class="blade-panel"><p class="eyebrow">RESUMEN ESTIMADO</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold my-3">Tu próxima salida</h2><p class="blade-actions justify-between"><span>Artículos</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.count"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-4"><span>Subtotal estimado</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.total)"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-3"><span>IVA estimado (16 %)</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.totals.tax)"></strong></p><p class="blade-actions justify-between my-4"><span>Total estimado</span><strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.totals.total)"></strong></p><div class="my-3 text-sm"><p>Total estimado MXN: <strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.estimateFor('MXN').total, 'MXN')"></strong></p><p>Total estimado USD: <strong x-text="$store.shop.price($store.shop.estimateFor('USD').total, 'USD')"></strong></p></div><p class="page-note">El importe final debe confirmarse en el servidor. No se envían estos importes al controlador.</p><a href="{{ route('store.checkout') }}" class="store-button primary mt-5">Ver checkout de muestra →</a></aside>
 </div>
</div>
